  "prefLabel": "Plc 1512.01 Practice Locations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1512.01 Practice Locations. Pursuant to RSA 326-E:6, I(e) a registered polysomnographic technologist shall engage in the limited scope of practice described in Plc 1512.02 only in a diagnostic laboratory or research setting.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 1500) #13496, INTERIM, eff 11-27-22; ss by #13621, eff 5-22-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 1500)",
